hibits a requester from approving their own request, including emergency requests, and E05 confirms that the plant-outage exception does not waive the requester self-approval prohibition.\"},{\"id\":\"emergency-spares-P05\",\"label\":\"supported\",\"source_units\":[\"E06\"],\"rationale\":\"E06 explicitly states that for a declared outage, the buyer must record the justification within two calendar days after order issuance, which entails recording it no later than two calendar days after issuance.\"},{\"id\":\"emergency-spares-P07\",\"label\":\"not_established\",\"source_units\":[\"E06\"],\"rationale\":\"E06 explicitly states that the policy does not prescribe the record storage system, and no source unit mentions the Oracle portal. Whether the buyer must use the Oracle portal is therefore left open and not established by the source documents.\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1119,"completion_tokens":3880,"total_tokens":4999,"cost":0.0451418,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.0451418,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.0024618,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.04268},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":3332,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}